==English==
{{wp}}

===Etymology===
Medieval ({{der|en|enm|-}}) given name from {{der|en|fro|Josse}}, name of a seventh century saint Latinized as ''[[Jodocus]]'', from {{der|en|br|Iodoc}}, diminutive of {{m|br|iudh||lord}}, from {{der|en|cel-pro|*yowdos}}.<ref> Patrick Hanks and Flavia Hodges: A Dictionary of Surnames. Oxford University Press 1988.</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/dʒɔɪs/}}
